20619 0 obj
  << /ActualText (About the report\nThe State of Kotlin 2026 report is both a retrospective \023 tracking how a JVM newcomer became a mature\054 multi\055domain ecosystem and infrastructure \023 and a forward\055looking view of the road ahead\054 exploring Kotlin\031s role across Android\054 backend\054 multiplatform\054 and AI\055assisted engineering\056\nIt is written for engineering leaders\054 system architects\054 and technical decision makers who need to understand where Kotlin fits into existing systems and what its trajectory implies for hiring\054 tooling\054 and platform strategy\056\nOur use of data\nThis report draws on multiple sources\054 including JetBrains\031 own annual State of Developer Ecosystem Survey\054 Kotlin Multiplatform Survey\054 and Kotlin Developer Survey\054 plus outside resources including independent industry reports\054 case studies\054 and external market data\056 Every claim is grounded in survey data\054 ecosystem facts and figures\054 or independent third\055party sources\056 Where a finding is provisional or open to interpretation\054 we state this clearly\056)
     /K [ 0 ]
