  << /ActualText (Kotlin is a programming language created \050by JetBrains \023 one of the company\047s core technologies\054 alongside its integrated development environments\054 data science \050and team tools\054 and AI offerings\056\050\050A modern language with concise syntax \050and built\055in null safety\054 it runs on the JVM \050and interoperates fully with existing Java codebases\056\n\nThat compatibility\054 coupled with Google\047s recognition of Kotlin as the preferred \050language for Android\054 has made it a trusted choice for a diverse set of applications\054 including mobile\054 backend\054 and multiplatform\056 This section looks back at Kotlin\047s story so far\056)
