20849 0 obj
  << /ActualText (When filtered for Kotlin\054 2020\0232025 data from JetBrains\031 annual Developer Ecosystem \050Survey shows a consistent industry pattern\056 Mobile leads the table\054 but there\031s a broad range of sectors behind\054 and a long tail of representation almost everywhere software is created\056\nIT services is consistently the next\055largest\054 followed by cloud computing\054 platform engineering\054 and software development tools at around 15\045 each\056 Financial technology \050is also a stronghold\072 Combining banking and other fintech\054 it hits the high teens and low twenties in different years\056 The pattern sharpens for those who use Kotlin on the backend\072 \050In the 2024 and 2025 surveys\054 more than one in five Kotlin backend developers \05022\045\02323\045\051 worked in fintech\054 and e\055commerce climbed to fourth place at 16\045\02317\045\056\nBeyond these\054 Kotlin maintains a steady presence across data analytics\054 healthcare IT\054\240 \050IoT and cybersecurity\054 and other areas\056 Published case studies map onto this spread \023 \050Cash App and ING in financial services\054 Philips in healthcare\054 Duolingo in education\054 Forbes \050in media\054 and McDonald\031s in consumer\055facing services\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 20850 0 R
     /Pg 5747 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
