20906 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Kotlin and Java are widely used together in different companies\054 teams\054 and projects\054 interoperating smoothly\056 Kotlin makes an explicit point of co\055operating well with existing Java\055based systems so that it can be introduced gradually into existing applications and infrastructure without wholesale rewrites\056\nWith Java and Kotlin happily co\055existing in the same codebase\054 organizations can preserve frameworks\054 libraries\054 tooling\054 and team expertise\054 maximizing the value of existing IT investments while benefitting from Kotlin\031s conciseness\054 null safety\054 enhanced developer experience\054 and measurable productivity gains\056\nA clear majority of Kotlin developers report Java being their previous choice of language\054 meaning they\031re comfortable with the ecosystem\056 Consequently\054 adopting Kotlin is widely viewed as a low\055risk strategy\054 without disruptive rip\055and\055replace migrations\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 20907 0 R
     /Pg 6001 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
