20923 0 obj
  << /ActualText (A clear sign that organizations trust Kotlin is where they run it\056 Production deployment \050is the point of high commitment\072 It implies code review\054 operational support\054 \050and a maintenance horizon measured in years\056\nIn the 2025 Developer Ecosystem Survey\054 a large proportion of Kotlin developers reported using the language for real production code \023 not prototypes\054 side projects\054 or evaluation sandboxes\054 but in business systems companies depend on\056\nOther figures add color\056 As Kotlin experience has deepened\054 over half of developers in our survey use it for backend projects\054 and nearly a third for multiplatform \023 serious multi\055discipline uses\056 It\031s evident that across domains \023 cloud\054 server\054 desktop\054 or mobile devices \050\023 Kotlin shows significant penetration into each segment\056\nKotlin is increasingly used as a long\055term production technology rather than a language \050for experimentation or isolated projects\056 And with long\055term institutions now supporting \050the language \023 the Kotlin Foundation providing guidance and governance\054 and JetBrains\031 relationship with Spring \023 Kotlin is no longer an interesting tool for individual \050experimentation\054 but a genuine part of enterprise production environments\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 20924 0 R
     /Pg 6503 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

