20973 0 obj
  << /ActualText (In 2025\054 JetBrains research estimated 8\0561 million developers worldwide have Kotlin experience\056 The pool of people who can code in Kotlin has expanded steadily in the language\031s second decade\056\nThis pool has depth\054 too\056 The 2025 Kotlin Developer Survey found that about half of Kotlin developers had been using the language for at least three years\054 meaning a significant share have moved well beyond initial experimenting\056 The cohort with the most experience continues to grow\054 with developers actively deepening their knowledge over time\056\nAs you\031d expect\054 the cohort with four or more years of Kotlin experience has grown strongly since 2021\056 For employers\054 the practical effect is positive\072 a hiring pool populated by developers with genuine skills and expertise using Kotlin in actual business environments\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 20974 0 R
     /Pg 6995 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
