  << /ActualText (This move to production readiness has been matched by another trend\072 acceleration in uptake\056 \050Our Developer Ecosystem data shows that KMP\047s share among cross\055platform developers more than doubled from 2024 to 2025\054 a considerable rate of change for an established framework category\056\nAdoption at the organizational level tells the same story\056 According to Appfigures data\054 KMP\047s presence among the top 10\054000 App Store apps nearly tripled\054 from under 1\045 in early 2024 \050to almost 3\045 by mid\0552026\056 Over the past year\054 KMP added more apps to the top 10\054000 than Flutter did\054 despite starting from a far smaller base\056 The commercial weight is real\054 too\072 \050By mid\0552026\054 KMP apps in the top 10\054000 matched Flutter apps in total App Store revenue\054 and KMP\055based applications serve hundreds of millions of users daily\056 Taken together\054 these are the signs of a technology going mainstream\056)
