  << /ActualText (Published case studies from Duolingo\054 Booking\056com\054 Sony\054 BiliBili\054 Philips\054 Bolt\054 Cash App\054 McDonald\031s\054 and others describe the same benefits qualitatively\072 less duplicated work\054 faster feature delivery\054 more consistent behavior across platforms\054 and smoother coordination between mobile teams\056 The common thread is\072 KMP improves delivery efficiency without a wholesale rewrite\056 Shared business logic\054 gradual adoption paths\054 and retained native UX let teams capture the savings of code\055sharing \023 while keeping the flexibilities specific to each platform\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
