21720 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Asked how AI\055generated Kotlin code usually turns out\054 respondents were positive but precise\072 In about four cases out of five\054 the result is working code after minor fixes\056 Only about one in seven report significant rework\056 The gaps respondents describe are rarely syntax\073 most of the time\054 they are project context\054 idioms\054 architecture\054 and current APIs\056 That is where Kotlin\047s compiler and type system earn their keep \050see 6\0561\051\054 as a whole class of AI mistakes fails to compile before it can fail in production\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 21721 0 R
