  << /ActualText (Kotlin developers have moved AI from experiment to daily practice \023 93\045 use AI \050coding tools\054 and companies are scaling adoption deliberately\054 pilot by pilot\056 \050The results hold up\072 Over 80\045 of surveyed KotlinConf attendees find AI\055generated Kotlin code correct or near\055correct\054 and validation \050is universal practice\054 with the compiler and \050type system lowering its cost\056 Current benchmark and survey results show that \050leading coding agents can complete a high \050share of evaluated Kotlin engineering tasks\056 Results remain task\055\054 repository\055\054 and setup\055dependent\056)
